__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
# Memory dumps and fitted arrays — regenerate them with tools/, don't commit them.
*.npz
*.bin
# ...except these two. worker 不再装它们(色调微调改成了直接复刻引擎的造表过程,
# 见 PIPELINE.md 6.2.3),但它们是「微调与外观无关」这个结论的**独立实测佐证** ——
# 那时还没读到代码,是先量出来的。重测要几百次渲染,其中一台机身这里也没有。
!tools/look_tuning_perlook_7cm2.npz
!tools/look_tuning_a7v.npz
tools/sliderprobe_work.ARW
tools/sweep_work.ARW
tools/toneprobe_work.ARW
tools/sliderprobe/*.npy
